    {
      "id": 7210149511266,
      "title": "Virche Evermore -EpiC: Lycoris- Nintendo Switch™",
      "handle": "virche-evermore-epic-lycoris-nintendo-switch™",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Online Exclusive Edition Contents:<br></strong>- Virche Evermore -EpiC: Lycoris- for Nintendo Switch™<br>- A special 3.5\" x 5\" 3-piece acrylic diorama<br>- A set of exclusive character cards<br><br><strong>Standard Edition Contents:<br></strong>- Virche Evermore -EpiC: Lycoris- for Nintendo Switch™<br><br></p>\n<h1 class=\"text-beside-image__title\">Game Info</h1>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Virche Evermore -EpiC: Lycoris- explores five unique, all-new tales:<br></p>\n<p><strong>Side Story -Interlude- </strong><br>Various events within the main story, what-if stories, the men’s pasts, and other stories yet to be told.</p>\n<p><strong>Side End -Encore-</strong><br>New, extended pathways created by the girl called “Death” and the ¬men surrounding her.</p>\n<p><strong>Virche de la Coda -Émotion-</strong><br>Discover what future awaits these characters: Happiness? Promise? Eternal salvation? This mode includes epilogues for the Despair and Salvation endings of the original game.</p>\n<p><strong>Tradition -Drifter-</strong> <br>An untold story of the founder of the family that secretly guards the lycoris flowers, and how he changed the country's fate. </p>\n<p><strong>Virche du Salut -Ankou-</strong><br>A new story of the Watchman of Death and the key he holds to the maiden of death's future.<br></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jcj8QAilSoY?si=LtL8TKx_B-TGKowR\" title=\"YouTube video player\"></iframe></p>\n<div class=\"rte\">\n<p><strong>Release Date:</strong><span> 7th November</span> 2024<br><strong>Platform:<span> </span></strong>Nintendo Switch™<br><strong>Genre:<span> </span></strong>Adventure Romance<strong><br>Player(s):<span> </span></strong>1<br><strong>In Game Audio:<span> </span></strong><span>Japanese</span><br><strong>In Game Text:<span> </span></strong><span>English</span><br><strong>Rating:<span> </span></strong>PEGI 12<br><strong>Developer:<span> </span></strong>IDEA FACTORY<br><strong>Publisher:<span> </span></strong>Aksys Games</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<p><span>©2024 IDEA FACTORY All rights reserved. Licensed to and published by Aksys Games</span></p>\n<!---->",
