      "body_html": "<h3 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">COMING 15th February 2024!</h3>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The 3rd instalment in the Spirit Hunter series -<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><em data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Death Mar</strong><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">k II</strong></em> will keep you wondering what else will happen.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The long-awaited sequel to 2018’s award-winning horror visual novel is coming to Western audiences next year!</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><em>**Includes Store Exclusive Soundtrack CD of 14 Tracks while stocks last**</em></strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Release Date:</strong> 15th February 2024<br></p>\n<div class=\"column\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"column\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"column\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"column\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"column\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"column\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></div>\n<p class=\"p2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Platform:</strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span>Nintendo Switch™</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Genre:</strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Horror Adventure </span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Player(s):</strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span>1</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Rating:</strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span>PEGI 16</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Developer:</strong><span d